{
  "id": "JDG.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Fuga Laja Girgweaguutka 15",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata eawoojisu ng'ay, damanda lajita ngaano, gawa Samsoni googeachi gatmoadaanyi nea ghwaada geadi dayeenda mbooyda; ak gwayi, “Gaydawa jeeda geeda gatmoodeanyu.” Ak ea moadawa beata ghweanda gatmoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha ghweanda gatmooda, “Aniini geayeeshi geawi mibwariinyi; hean ghaadawji siida iduupcheewi. Neada huda geanyaawa mwanang' ea mii miy ea ghang'al niny? Geamuscheey gheana nih aba badaydaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Samsoni saawa, “Eanean gheadi maydandeawa ramaseanda aba badahuuka fuga Filisti, iyaabwarji goosha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Samsoni ak goong'oonyu fureayooni bughalaji samwagu, ak gageanu beascheeka ak gwarasiinyi shoomng'eega fureayoonga, ng'ata goojoon beasta heeda sirasiinyi shoomng'eega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ning'uda beasta shoomng'eega, gwasiksa fureayoonga gwasalsa jeeda booga fuga Filisti, ak ghwaak beasta muschooniga, ea booga miinaada ea madameega sabiibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi fuga Filisti, “Gwasimaneasa ng'eaha ng'asheanji?” Ak gwayi suurja, “Samsoni gil, agweaji siida Dimna, aba gideaba ghaweat gatmoadaanyi ak ghoadaw siida duupchi Samsoni.” Hean ghapka fuga Filisti ak ghaghwarda gatmoodida ea ghwaan aba beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Samsoni saawa, “Ak ghamneawa gidoosinyi agooga iinih gil, aba huumwa gaydaak habeawooda aba badahuukeagwa, ama ng'ata gaydanung'waada.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwar muuchi miyeeda haw, ak ghwararang'aada goobiida burgadeeda lagheaneeda Edomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni ghwajoar fuga Filisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadiyeada fuga Filisti ak ghwadeas museasooda aba Yuda, ak goodearsa geat Lehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi fuga Yuda, “Ghwasaan ang'iing'i ginuunyi ng'ucheeweasa?” Hean gwayeesha, “Geapkaanyi eang'waanya Samsoni, eehinda gida simaneasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay fih sagalamnyooji samwagu bea Yuda aba jeeda beashadeeda lagheaneeda Etamu, ak gwayeesha Samsoni, “Neada ea minali gideaba fuga Filisti goombaleasa? Ak ghamneawa ea naaha gida isimaneasa?” “Gida ghayi simaneani saawa ghoah gideasimi eara saawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa niny, “Geapkaanyi eang'waanyeeyi ak geahaaknyi geatinga fuga Filisti.” Ak gwayeesha Samsoni, “Ayeaksean habeawooda gideaba majanuuseani agooga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Manda; gajearateey ak geayinyeeyi geatinga nyaawa; aseasa majeenuuseey.” Hean geerada ghealooni iyeenya gudea eesh, ak geeruuna jeeda lagheaneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea ghwahita Lehi, ghapka fuga Filisti gwaroonyi niny nea goojuur; ak ghwahidu headaanyi guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA aba uurda, ak ghealooniga mida geatingaaschi gawuurji nyootka siichoon beasta aba ghealooniga sirasa geatinga goobitpisa ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadaah geapkeeda shabwaat bea ganyamooda digeeda, ak ghabwara fih sagalamda aba geapkeedida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Samsoni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaak muwoash, ak gaguursa NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i ninyakneasa lealeanooda haw aba geatinga siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda; ghamneawa gaygwanuusan muwooshta, ak geabisi geatinga fuga miyeeyiili?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean ghwasaaw ASEETA shoomanda mida Lehi, ak gwarina beega jeeda, ak hean iinea nileayda gwaduudu gurooroadaanyi, ak gahoosan. Ak gheawungeaba hoowa geeguura Enhakore; gwanda Lehi ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoah siida laja girgweaguutka fuga Israeli aba gweanyeew diktam damanda ambaliischi fuga Filisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
